## Scope note (third-party code is NOT relicensed)

This repository mixes in-house/custom content with third-party deliveries that
keep their own licenses. The MIT license above applies to custom code, scripts,
and documentation authored for this repository (including the `docs/` site
sources and hand-written module pages).

The following are NOT covered by the MIT license and remain under their
original terms (see the original files and the docs site for details):

- Vector Software Integration Package (SIP) files under `BSW/`, GENy output
  under `Demo/DemoFbl/Appl/Gendata`, `Generators/`, and `Makesupport/`
  (Vector Informatik; modification without written permission voids warranty
  per the SIP ReadMe; license serial CBD1400501).
- Texas Instruments F021 Flash API under
  `BSW/Flash/Build/F021_Flash_API_v02.00.01` (TI license agreement included
  in that directory).
- Vendored GNU/Cygwin tools under `Makesupport/cmd` (GPL/Cygwin terms in
  that directory).
- Tool binaries such as `FlashTool/vFlashTemplateInstaller*` and
  `Misc/HexView/hexview.exe` plus DLLs (vendor terms; HexView disclaimer in
  `Misc/HexView/disclaimer.txt`).
- Original PDFs/HTML under `Doc/` and `Misc/` (Vector/TI copyright; converted
  Markdown in `docs/` is provided for search/readability, the originals
  remain authoritative).

Demo keys under `Misc/DemoKey_2048` are example-only and must not be used in
production.
